  "task": {
    "objective": "Carry or relay four expiring packets to their privately assigned opposite-side depots through three shared openings.",
    "natural_termination": "All four packets have been delivered or expired; otherwise truncate at 64 nonterminal steps.",
    "interaction": "A consenting adjacent handoff transfers the sole packet slot and its destination information. Broadcast single-cell reservations deny entry to other roles for a bounded duration. Conservative simultaneous collision rules prevent swaps and create congestion. Packet sponsorship and last-handler bonuses make help compete with private delivery interests.",
    "observation_access": "Fixed wall layout and depot identities are public. Roles observe themselves, couriers within Manhattan distance 3, and active packets within distance 2 or in their own custody. Every hidden packet value, including position, destination, timer, carrier and sponsor, is zeroed behind an explicit visible bit. Reservation locations/timers and delivery/expiry radio receipts are public. Inactive reservation positions remain public historical signals. Private handoff/pickup flags are not declared global scene events. The diagnostic full-state view must be separately labelled."
